#: setup.php
msgid "If the round-trip latency via any of the predefined Cacti ping methods raises above this threshold, log a warning or send email based upon the Devices Criticality and Monitor setting.  The unit is in milliseconds.  Setting to 0 disables. The Thold Plugin is required to leverage this functionality."
msgstr "Raha mihoatra an'io Fetra io ny fahatarana mandroso sy miverina amin'ny iray amin'ireo fomba ping Cacti voafaritra mialoha, dia raketo ny fampitandremana na mandefasa mailaka mifototra amin'ny Fandrindrana Fanaraha-maso sy ny Fahamatoran'ny Fitaovana. Milisegondra ny singa. Ny fametrahana azy ho 0 dia mampiato izany. Ilaina ny Thold Plugin mba hampiasana ity fiasa ity."

